# Large terrain/lighting data (binary .asset files) - add paths here if needed:
# Assets/Scenes/**/LightingData.asset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# Terrain data is always saved binary by Unity (Magic > Level > Create Level Terrain names it <Scene>_TerrainData.asset).
*TerrainData.asset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
